WEBVTT

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.500
'The world of Pokémon,

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.830
brimming with beauty, variety and majesty.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:25.210
As the most mysterious and magnificent

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.380
creatures on this planet,

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.260
there are over 700 species of Pokémon,

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.180
and they can be found wherever one looks.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.980
Pokémon have many
different skills and abilities,

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:42.560
and through a phenomenon called evolution,

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:45.190
they are able to grow and change.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:50.690
Most people and Pokémon live
happy and peaceful lives together,

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.820
as friends and companions.

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:58.450
And there are the Pokémon trainers,

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.330
who join forces with
Pokémon as battle partners,

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:04.920
displaying their skills in
competitive arenas everywhere.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:08.670
And because of the strong bond
between trainer and Pokémon,

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.130
a new, powerful phenomenon has arisen.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.140
During battle, a trainer's Key
Stone can have a particularly

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.430
synchronistic reaction with
the Pokémon's Mega Stone.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:22.180
This results in a temporary
but profound increase

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.230
in the power of a Pokémon.

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:27.110
This transformation is
known as Mega Evolution.

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.820
The mystery of Pokémon.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:40.080
Perhaps it is that mystery that exists

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.290
at the very heart of the world itself.'

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.806
Hm?

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:16.877
I've got it on screen.
What do you know? Hm?

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:19.050
I've got it on screen. What do you know?

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.300
Coming back here to get it, huh?

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.660
I don't think so.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.790
I'm not simply going to hand it over.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.960
Alakazam! Glalie!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.840
Mega Wave.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.010
Glalie! Kazam!

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:13.190
Kazam!

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.020
Glalie!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.990
Alakazam!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.120
Ha!

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.380
Use Freeze Dry!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.760
Glalie!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.040
Pika!

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.000
Great! All set. Pika!

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.130
Thanks for the help, Ash.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.010
Here, Serena. This, too!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:25.430
'This young man is Ash
Ketchum from Pallet Town.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.550
He wants to be a Pokémon Master.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.640
He and his partner, Pikachu,
along with his friends,

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.930
are continuing their training journey.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.350
And today, it's time for some
Pokémon battle practice.'

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.320
Clemont, don't hold back. OK? Pikachu!

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.610
Holding back is not what
I do. Pin-pin! Chespin!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.740
Hm! Hm!

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.410
Now, Bunnelby, I need your help.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.330
Bun! Bunnelby!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:53.450
Let's go, Noivern.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:55.580
Vern!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.390
♪ I stand tall cos I know I'm a winner

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.610
♪ You've met your match
♪ You know I'm no beginner

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.530
♪ No beginner

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:15.950
♪ Gotta catch 'em all

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:34.930
♪ I stand tall cos I know I'm a winner

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:38.310
♪ Knock me down ♪ I'll just get up again

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.560
♪ You've met your match
♪ Yeah, I'm no beginner

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:46.770
♪ Pokémon ♪ Gotta catch 'em all

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:57.030
♪ You've met your match
♪ Hey, I'm no beginner

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:01.910
♪ Pokémon ♪ Gotta catch 'em all

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:05.130
♪ I've got my friends beside me

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:09.050
♪ I'm keeping my eye on the ball

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.800
♪ With the wisdom of years to guide me

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:16.640
♪ I'm gonna catch 'em all ♪

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:03.040
No! I'll have to re-wash these.

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:06.210
Too bad. Serena, did something just fall?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:10.220
Huh?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.090
Hey, Pikachu?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.930
Pikachu!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.760
You OK?

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.510
Oh!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.640
Whoa!

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.810
Argh!

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.940
Whoa...

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:29.490
Oh! What was that? Pikachu?

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.570
Pika! Oh!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.920
Whoa-a-a-a! Pika!

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:46.960
Whoa-a-a-a!

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.680
Look, human. How many times
are you going to bump into me?

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.810
Hey! You can talk!

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.140
Pika! Is it telepathy?

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:02.270
Well?

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.850
Uh...

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.980
Wait...

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.860
That's... What IS this?

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.860
Pi... Pika? It's stuck!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.570
Huh?

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:22.500
Amazing!

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:25.000
An electromagnetic pulse!

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.790
I've got no time for this.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.220
Whoa!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.300
Stop banging into me!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.430
Whoa-a-a!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.350
Oh-h-h!

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:52.320
Knock it off, already!
I'm not doing anything!

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.450
It's the EM pulse!

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:57.570
An electromagnetic pulse is
flowing between those bands!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:59.320
Huh? What's that mean?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:03.330
Basically, they're being linked
together by an invisible force.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.960
Oh, that's just great.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:08.080
Pika? Huh?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.210
Hold on!

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:13.550
Pikachu! Cut it out!

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.760
Are you listening to me?!

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.140
Oh! Poor Ash!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.740
Ah!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.700
Slow down! Man, my stomach hurts.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.330
Why, human? This is none of your concern!

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.880
Argh!

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.680
Whoa-a-a-a!

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:16.030
Yummy time!

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.070
And that's delish!

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.330
Huh?

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:35.460
What are you doing?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.720
Because of you, I can't get my balance.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.180
- Not again! Whoa! - It's twerp time!

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:52.230
Oh, yes! So, we finally meet.

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:54.360
This way, please.

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.820
I am the Prince of the Azoth Kingdom.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.950
My name is Rali.

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.910
Hm?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.880
'Your heart and soul will be the fortress

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.930
that will protect the
people of our kingdom.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:26.220
At least, that is my fervent hope.'

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.980
I'm sorry if you had
any trouble getting here.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.650
Please forgive me.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.780
Huh?

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.960
Mm-hm. Is that the Pokémon?

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.750
The one who wants to
take you back, Magearna?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.420
Magearna? Oh!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.930
Mega Wave!

00:13:20.560 --> 00:13:22.650
Glalie!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:25.320
Alakazam!

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.740
Gengar!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.870
Mega Evolution?

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:35.670
Why, you - Gengar, Psychic!

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.310
Glalie, Ice Beam!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.150
Oh!

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.570
Now, please don't get worked up.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:12.830
Flamel, any other information?

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:15.660
Extrapolating from witness reports,

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.790
what came flying in was a Pokémon.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.920
It's called Volcanion.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.800
Volcanion?

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:27.010
A mythical Pokémon that is said
to live in the mists of Nebel Plateau.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:29.140
A mythical Pokémon...

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:32.220
Princess? Please be careful.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.350
I will.

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:50.780
Volcanion? That's what you're called?

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.870
Magearna represents the
very future of our kingdom.

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.000
I want you to understand that.

00:14:56.820 --> 00:15:00.210
Hey! It takes nerve to freeze it
and then ask it to understand.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:03.000
Oh! It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.130
I am Rali, the prince of this kingdom.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:09.220
Prince, huh? So, then, who might you be?

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.350
I'm Ash, from Pallet Town.

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:13.470
I'm a Pokémon trainer.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.230
Well, then, please let me explain!

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:22.770
See, Magearna was built by
someone using arcane science long ago.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.070
Magearna is a Pokémon.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:29.110
A Pokémon? That's correct! A Pokémon!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:32.240
Magearna was created over 500 years ago.

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:35.580
It is the only one of its
kind in the whole wide world.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:40.210
Huh? Way back then, a great
master of arcane science named Nikola

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:42.330
lived in our kingdom.

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.250
He created many wonderful inventions,

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.670
based on the skills of Pokémon,

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.430
which brought great riches to our land.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:55.760
Magearna was created by Nikola,

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.930
who presented it to the royal family.

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:02.270
Then, it is said Magearna lived happily

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.860
with the princess at that time.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:11.450
But sadly, amidst the chaos of war,
Magearna's whereabouts were lost.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:14.990
But today, we have
finally found it once again!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.040
Mm-hm!

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.950
Whoa-a-a!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.420
Alakazam! Whoa-a-a!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.390
Pika-pi!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.110
Hawlucha! Magearna, let's go.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.740
Rali, and Alva too.

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.370
Could it be?

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.350
Hmm...

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.150
Could this be?

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.740
Denne! Denne!

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.870
Ray!

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:44.670
Whoa!

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:48.420
Huh?

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:51.880
Dedenne!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.230
Clemont! We've gotta hurry!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.350
Over here!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:10.110
Clemont? Serena! Bonnie!

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:12.230
This is incredible! This
is the Azoth kingdom.

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:16.950
The Azoth kingdom?

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.950
It's an ultra-mechanised city!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:24.290
Built by the great scientist Nikola
using arcane science and art.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.710
Mechanised?

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:28.830
Nikola was a genius!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.550
He's truly one of my all-time idols.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:36.630
He used Pokémon skills as
inspiration for his many inventions.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.050
Truly a great man!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.760
Denne, denne!

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:47.600
Slur! Slurpuff!

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.660
Peekaboo!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.710
For you, I would walk
through fire and water.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.840
Pika-pi!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:18.760
Huh? Pikachu!

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.140
So, they call you Volcanion, don't they?

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.680
Hm, and what if they do?

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.600
Hm...

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:31.650
Magearna! You really are
a one-of-a-kind Pokémon.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.020
Pika!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.150
Magearna, everything OK?

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.320
My name's Ash, and this is my pal Pikachu.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.330
Pika, Pikachu!

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:46.120
It's nice to meet you too -

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.250
Oh! Don't touch it!

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.210
Pika?

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.300
Pika? Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.100
I can't blast anything without water.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.220
You can't? Pika!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.060
Don't worry. If those guys show
up again, we'll chase them away.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.480
I don't need help from humans.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.900
Pikachu!

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.820
Stay out of this, electric nuisance!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:22.450
Pika! Pika, Pikachu!

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:26.990
Listen up! I'll tell you just once.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.790
I will NEVER trust humans.

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:34.000
And Pokémon like you who cosy up to humans?

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.920
I don't trust them either!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.670
Pika-pika!

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:40.590
What, pipsqueak? Wanna fight?

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:44.430
Come on... Everybody just calm down now.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.350
Pi? Pika?

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.480
Dedenne! We found them!

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.610
Ash! Everyone!

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.070
I see.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:06.910
You say that you know
that young boy trainer?

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:11.080
Boy, do we ever! Quite!
For a very long time.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.210
Too long! You have no idea.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:16.460
And you call yourselves Team
Rocket. I'll need more information.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.250
More? Sure!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:25.590
Just meeting the mythical Pokémon
Volcanion would have been amazing.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:29.220
But to actually meet Nikola's
greatest creation of all time?!

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.350
I'm honoured!

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.940
Oh!

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:36.770
Uh...

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.610
It's never coming off. Pika...

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.730
You humans are useless.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.530
That's not nice. Pika-pika!

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.660
I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

00:21:45.690 --> 00:21:47.450
Oh!

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:55.420
Thank you, Magearna!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:58.130
You're a Pokémon treasure! Don't touch it!

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:00.420
Look out!

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:02.550
Whoa! Pika!

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:08.930
Why me?

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:10.640
Pika...

00:22:10.670 --> 00:22:12.560
Hi there! We're back.

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:14.690
Huh?

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:16.810
Magearna?

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:22.990
Amazing! Incredible!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.320
Kinda like a Pokéball!

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:27.450
Pikachu!

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:29.580
Ash? Huh? Ta-dah!

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.580
Since your clothes are a
mess, how about you try these?

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:34.710
Hm.

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:36.830
Uh...

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:39.790
Hm... Wow! You look great.

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:41.920
Really?

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:44.090
Pikachu, Magearna, do I? Pika-pika!

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:48.340
Stop it, Magearna.

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.600
Don't get involved with these humans.

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:56.190
I refuse.

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:58.310
Leave me alone!

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:10.530
Ah...

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:13.040
Ah-h-h...

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:21.790
Hey, I told you to quit it, didn't I?

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:27.260
OK, fine. I'll do my best.

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:34.680
Magearna!

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:44.980
Are you all right?

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.030
Magearna, you're soaking wet.

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:54.160
We'll get you all dried up. Dedenne!

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:57.120
Well, that's a relief.

00:23:57.150 --> 00:23:59.500
Though you've gotta
admit, Magearna's heavy!

00:24:00.820 --> 00:24:02.920
Dedenne?

00:24:02.950 --> 00:24:05.050
Pika?

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:07.090
It looks embarrassed.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.220
Because it fell?

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:12.430
Uh... I don't think Magearna
likes being called heavy.

00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:15.680
You're kidding! Of
course it doesn't like that.

00:24:17.840 --> 00:24:19.980
I'm so very sorry. Please forgive me.

00:24:20.010 --> 00:24:23.810
Clemont means well. He just
doesn't understand some things.

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:27.690
We should go. The sun is setting.

00:24:31.520 --> 00:24:33.620
No.

00:24:35.650 --> 00:24:37.750
I said no!

00:24:38.700 --> 00:24:40.790
I won't bring humans along.

00:24:41.990 --> 00:24:44.080
Hey. Where are you going?

00:24:44.120 --> 00:24:46.210
Come back!

00:24:48.040 --> 00:24:50.130
Not again!

00:24:50.750 --> 00:24:52.840
Oh!

00:24:53.590 --> 00:24:55.680
Pika-pi!

00:25:02.050 --> 00:25:05.060
We need to get away, right now.

00:25:08.180 --> 00:25:10.990
Get moving, or I'll leave you behind!

00:25:20.820 --> 00:25:22.920
Rali, wait.

00:25:22.950 --> 00:25:25.040
Chymia, what is it?

00:25:25.080 --> 00:25:27.710
I saw you standing up
on the tower wall before,

00:25:27.740 --> 00:25:29.840
and you were with Alva as well.

00:25:29.870 --> 00:25:32.720
What were you up to?
A scientific investigation.

00:25:32.750 --> 00:25:36.850
Many of the amazing machines
built by Nikola are operating even now.

00:25:36.880 --> 00:25:39.180
Oh, is that all? Listen to me.

00:25:39.210 --> 00:25:41.180
If you really wanna learn,

00:25:41.220 --> 00:25:43.440
look to the future, not just to the past.

00:25:43.470 --> 00:25:46.860
The future? To do that, you
need to learn about the past!

00:25:49.810 --> 00:25:52.950
Father is worried about you as well.

00:25:52.980 --> 00:25:55.610
Alva was with me, so
there was no need to worry.

00:25:55.650 --> 00:25:57.830
But that's why he's worried.

00:25:57.860 --> 00:26:02.120
Now, you know that Father
trusts Alva completely, just like I do!

00:26:02.150 --> 00:26:06.130
He thinks a lot more about our
kingdom's future than you do.

00:26:07.700 --> 00:26:10.300
So if you'll please excuse me...

00:26:10.330 --> 00:26:12.420
I have to go.

00:26:22.220 --> 00:26:25.100
- One, two... - Ta-dah!

00:26:25.140 --> 00:26:27.230
Whoa! Pika...

00:26:27.260 --> 00:26:29.020
Isn't it cute, Volcanion?

00:26:39.690 --> 00:26:41.790
Huh?

00:26:41.820 --> 00:26:43.910
Well... that went over well

00:26:43.950 --> 00:26:46.370
Maybe it's shy. Could be, right, Magearna?

00:26:48.490 --> 00:26:51.630
Getting friendly, aren't they? Sure are.

00:26:51.660 --> 00:26:55.470
Since we're stuck together
now, might as well have fun.

00:26:55.500 --> 00:26:58.640
I agree. Nonsense. I just
wanna get away from you.

00:26:58.670 --> 00:27:01.600
Nothing good comes from
interacting with humans.

00:27:01.630 --> 00:27:04.730
You fell out of the sky with
these bands, remember?

00:27:04.760 --> 00:27:06.850
Look, humans made these things.

00:27:06.890 --> 00:27:10.400
Well, it sure wasn't us.
All humans are the same.

00:27:10.430 --> 00:27:12.520
Oh!

00:27:15.520 --> 00:27:18.860
Hey, you. What are you
doing hanging around like that?

00:27:18.900 --> 00:27:22.330
Get your filthy human hands off me!

00:27:22.360 --> 00:27:24.790
No, I won't! Now, I said! No, you first!

00:27:24.820 --> 00:27:27.960
I'll blast you off.

00:27:41.000 --> 00:27:45.930
If they're headed somewhere,
it's probably Nebel Plateau.

00:27:45.970 --> 00:27:49.440
The place with the field of
flowers where Magearna was found!

00:27:49.470 --> 00:27:51.560
Yes.

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:54.270
Members of Team Rocket,
please go and investigate.

00:27:54.310 --> 00:27:56.240
Count on us, sir!

00:27:58.190 --> 00:28:00.280
It's all finished!

00:28:00.310 --> 00:28:03.080
What is? Have a look for yourselves.

00:28:03.110 --> 00:28:05.870
The future is now, thanks to science!

00:28:06.530 --> 00:28:08.250
Huh? Pika?

00:28:09.490 --> 00:28:11.830
I made this protective suit

00:28:11.870 --> 00:28:15.130
inspired by moves like
Iron Defence and Protect.

00:28:15.160 --> 00:28:17.260
It's called Mr Iron Defence.

00:28:17.290 --> 00:28:19.380
Whoa-ho!

00:28:19.420 --> 00:28:22.510
You're protected from any kind of attack.

00:28:24.090 --> 00:28:26.770
What do I see?

00:28:26.800 --> 00:28:28.890
Looks like a campfire.

00:28:28.930 --> 00:28:31.480
Maybe they're setting up camp here tonight.

00:28:31.510 --> 00:28:33.610
We have to tell Alva!

00:28:33.640 --> 00:28:35.900
Wait. Our real boss is the Prince.

00:28:35.930 --> 00:28:39.110
Once we can get our hands
on what he wants, we'll be rich.

00:28:39.140 --> 00:28:42.820
Brilliant! And that's rich!
Let's make some dough.

00:28:50.110 --> 00:28:52.210
Pika?

00:28:52.240 --> 00:28:54.330
You sensed it, too?

00:29:01.250 --> 00:29:03.180
Pika!

00:29:03.210 --> 00:29:05.180
Pikachu-u-u-u!

00:29:05.210 --> 00:29:09.060
Huh?

00:29:09.090 --> 00:29:10.850
Oh! Magearna!

00:29:13.010 --> 00:29:15.110
Yoo-hoo!

00:29:16.140 --> 00:29:18.230
From now on, Magearna's our guest.

00:29:18.270 --> 00:29:20.990
Team Rocket! What are you guys doing here?

00:29:21.020 --> 00:29:25.450
Heracross and Pinsir? Hey!
Where are your normal Pokémon?

00:29:25.480 --> 00:29:28.330
We're not your normal
Team Rocket. Check this out!

00:29:28.360 --> 00:29:31.790
Mega Wave, Team Rocket!

00:29:31.820 --> 00:29:33.830
What?! Key Stones!

00:29:33.870 --> 00:29:37.750
We've joined forces with
the good Prince Rali. No way!

00:29:37.790 --> 00:29:40.920
See? We're Mega Wave Team Rocket!

00:29:43.830 --> 00:29:45.930
Pika!

00:29:45.960 --> 00:29:48.060
Mega Wave!

00:29:57.010 --> 00:29:59.440
Mega Evolved?! But how? To Mega Evolve,

00:29:59.470 --> 00:30:02.900
there must be a close bond
between trainer and Pokémon.

00:30:02.940 --> 00:30:05.030
It's thanks to what Alva calls...

00:30:06.020 --> 00:30:08.120
Uh... what was it?

00:30:08.150 --> 00:30:10.240
Neo-arcane science.

00:30:10.280 --> 00:30:12.710
With this technology, we
can use Mega Evolution

00:30:12.740 --> 00:30:14.620
and we don't need any stinking bond!

00:30:14.660 --> 00:30:17.040
I see. So Gengar and the others?

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:21.300
Gengar!

00:30:21.330 --> 00:30:24.760
What about how the Pokémon
feel? That's not Mega Evolution!

00:30:24.790 --> 00:30:28.640
Arcane science was developed to
make people and Pokémon happy!

00:30:28.670 --> 00:30:30.890
You're defaming the memory of Nikola!

00:30:30.920 --> 00:30:32.980
Hey! We call it 'neo'

00:30:33.010 --> 00:30:35.940
because the technology
passed you by, science guy!

00:30:35.970 --> 00:30:38.060
Now, Heracross! Pinsir, too!

00:30:38.100 --> 00:30:40.190
Turn 'em into goo!

00:30:40.220 --> 00:30:42.320
Heracross!

00:30:43.060 --> 00:30:45.150
You, take Magearna away from here.

00:30:45.190 --> 00:30:48.320
I hate relying on humans,
but I have no choice.

00:30:48.360 --> 00:30:50.450
Go! Everyone, do it!

00:30:50.480 --> 00:30:53.000
All right! Let's go, Magearna.

00:30:53.030 --> 00:30:55.120
Leave it to us.

00:30:55.160 --> 00:30:57.250
Let 'er rip!

00:30:57.870 --> 00:30:59.960
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

00:30:59.990 --> 00:31:02.090
Pikachu-u-u-u!

00:31:13.470 --> 00:31:15.560
Get 'em, Volcanion!

00:31:15.590 --> 00:31:17.690
I don't need a cheerleader!

00:31:27.770 --> 00:31:29.870
Yes! Pika!

00:31:29.900 --> 00:31:32.790
Heracross! Pinsir!

00:31:41.620 --> 00:31:44.550
Success! It worked like a charm.

00:31:44.580 --> 00:31:47.130
Mega Evolution drew Volcanion away!

00:31:50.130 --> 00:31:52.220
Gardevoir!

00:31:53.550 --> 00:31:55.640
The nerve!

00:32:05.850 --> 00:32:09.950
Gardevoir, Mega Evolve!

00:32:18.780 --> 00:32:20.870
Gardevoir!

00:32:20.910 --> 00:32:23.420
Now there's a Mega Gardevoir in my face!

00:32:23.450 --> 00:32:25.550
Use Dazzling Gleam!

00:32:25.580 --> 00:32:27.670
Gardevoir-r-r!

00:32:33.500 --> 00:32:38.060
We're blasting off again!

00:32:41.720 --> 00:32:43.810
Huh?

00:32:45.680 --> 00:32:48.280
Wow, nothing! Huh?

00:32:51.350 --> 00:32:55.080
Pikachu! Pika!

00:32:55.110 --> 00:32:58.410
Let 'em have it, Volcanion.
Don't blame me for the results.

00:32:58.450 --> 00:33:00.540
Don't worry.

00:33:00.570 --> 00:33:04.000
Raaaargh!

00:33:14.210 --> 00:33:16.640
Huh? Pika, pika!

00:33:16.670 --> 00:33:19.680
Science is so amazing. Pika.

00:33:19.720 --> 00:33:21.810
Huh?

00:33:29.180 --> 00:33:32.030
So this is your real power.

00:33:32.060 --> 00:33:36.120
Ha! If I showed you my real
power, it wouldn't be just this.

00:33:36.150 --> 00:33:39.040
I've levelled a whole mountain. Awesome.

00:33:39.070 --> 00:33:41.290
Pika?

00:33:44.160 --> 00:33:47.750
Hey, Ash! What exploded? Huh?

00:33:47.790 --> 00:33:50.420
Hey, guys. Pika.

00:33:50.460 --> 00:33:53.180
Now I've got even more humans.

00:33:57.920 --> 00:34:01.600
Magearna, I'm Chymia, Princess of Azoth.

00:34:01.630 --> 00:34:03.600
Pleased to meet you.

00:34:03.640 --> 00:34:06.400
I'm a descendent of the Azoth royal family.

00:34:06.430 --> 00:34:08.320
Princess? Whoa.

00:34:31.040 --> 00:34:34.170
Oh, my! They're beautiful. Thank you.

00:34:34.210 --> 00:34:38.640
Volcanion, you were
protecting Magearna, right?

00:34:40.920 --> 00:34:42.930
Mm-hm.

00:34:45.300 --> 00:34:48.690
"For the kingdom."
That's what Rali said, huh?

00:34:48.720 --> 00:34:53.690
Right. One thing's for sure - Rali
believes everything that Alva tells him.

00:34:53.730 --> 00:34:56.610
That it's all for the good of the kingdom.

00:34:56.650 --> 00:35:00.120
Does Rali really trust this
Alva person that much?

00:35:00.150 --> 00:35:02.240
Yes.

00:35:02.280 --> 00:35:07.460
Ever since Rali was a boy,
he always adored Nikola.

00:35:07.490 --> 00:35:10.710
Many times he would spend
the entire day in his room,

00:35:10.740 --> 00:35:14.550
reading old texts and
performing experiments.

00:35:14.580 --> 00:35:17.220
And because of that, when he found out

00:35:17.250 --> 00:35:20.300
that Councillor Alva was an
arcane science researcher,

00:35:20.340 --> 00:35:23.560
he started to spend more
and more time with him.

00:35:28.140 --> 00:35:31.190
So now, since my
brother is involved in this,

00:35:31.220 --> 00:35:33.230
that means that I am too.

00:35:35.020 --> 00:35:37.110
Argh!

00:35:38.690 --> 00:35:42.740
Hey, why don't we just get on
board the thing they're riding on?

00:35:42.780 --> 00:35:45.250
Why would I board something humans built?

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:47.370
Oh, come on.

00:35:47.410 --> 00:35:50.080
Ah!

00:35:57.580 --> 00:36:00.510
The princess! I know.

00:36:02.630 --> 00:36:06.100
Dedenne! Wow, a field of flowers!

00:36:10.350 --> 00:36:12.770
Come to greet us, huh?

00:36:12.810 --> 00:36:15.730
What?

00:36:17.810 --> 00:36:20.110
Huh? Argh!

00:36:20.150 --> 00:36:22.240
Huh?

00:36:24.400 --> 00:36:27.450
Up ahead! Is that Amaura?

00:36:32.080 --> 00:36:34.500
Amaura's badly injured.

00:36:34.540 --> 00:36:37.920
Hold on.

00:36:37.960 --> 00:36:41.090
Hang in there.

00:36:44.170 --> 00:36:46.140
We'll take care of it!

00:36:46.170 --> 00:36:49.560
I don't need your help.
I'll carry Amaura myself.

00:36:53.930 --> 00:36:58.150
Argh!

00:36:58.180 --> 00:37:00.070
Ugh. Argh!

00:37:02.060 --> 00:37:06.160
Now this big one will fetch me an
even bigger price than that Amaura.

00:37:06.190 --> 00:37:08.330
A Pokémon hunter.

00:37:10.490 --> 00:37:13.000
Huh?

00:37:13.030 --> 00:37:15.420
All right, Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:37:15.450 --> 00:37:18.960
Pikachuuuuu!

00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:21.550
I'll fix all of you.

00:37:21.580 --> 00:37:25.010
Roooaaargh!

00:37:25.050 --> 00:37:27.140
Huh? Whoa.

00:37:27.170 --> 00:37:29.270
Argh!

00:37:31.680 --> 00:37:33.770
Argh!

00:37:46.820 --> 00:37:51.000
What a bad man.

00:37:51.030 --> 00:37:53.290
Pokémon hunters only want one thing.

00:37:53.320 --> 00:37:55.540
To make money stealing Pokémon.

00:37:55.580 --> 00:37:58.630
So, bad things like this,
do they happen a lot?

00:37:58.660 --> 00:38:02.590
Yes, but I can usually drive
them off by creating mist

00:38:02.620 --> 00:38:04.890
long before they get this far.

00:38:15.180 --> 00:38:17.270
Whoa. Pika.

00:38:21.940 --> 00:38:25.740
This is Nebel Plateau, our home.

00:38:31.740 --> 00:38:35.870
So many Pokémon! And they're totally cute!

00:38:47.500 --> 00:38:51.640
Drill, drill. Pika, pika!

00:38:51.670 --> 00:38:53.810
Pika? Dedenne?

00:38:53.840 --> 00:38:56.400
Everybody seems pretty afraid of us.

00:38:56.430 --> 00:38:59.480
You know why. You're humans, right?

00:38:59.510 --> 00:39:03.650
It does look like they don't trust
us at all. I wonder why that is.

00:39:09.190 --> 00:39:11.540
All right, I'll treat Amaura, don't worry.

00:39:11.570 --> 00:39:14.710
Treat? Don't just do whatever you want!

00:39:14.740 --> 00:39:18.290
Don't be so angry! You've
gotta trust us a little bit.

00:39:18.320 --> 00:39:20.880
You help too, Bonnie.

00:39:20.910 --> 00:39:22.800
- Sure! - Let me help too.

00:39:22.830 --> 00:39:25.010
I could help too.

00:39:28.880 --> 00:39:31.510
Does it sting? It'll all be over soon.

00:39:31.550 --> 00:39:34.180
You've just gotta be strong. Pika.

00:39:39.550 --> 00:39:41.570
The bandage is freezing.

00:39:41.600 --> 00:39:44.400
This sort of thing happens
with Ice Type Pokémon.

00:39:44.430 --> 00:39:48.070
It's proof of the healing. That
means the medicine's working.

00:39:48.100 --> 00:39:51.410
Amaura, that's so great! Dedenne.

00:39:51.440 --> 00:39:53.490
Amaura.

00:39:53.530 --> 00:39:57.290
Forget all the bad times,
you're in a safe place now.

00:39:57.320 --> 00:39:59.920
We have food here. You have friends too.

00:39:59.950 --> 00:40:04.250
Amaura. Sleep now, Amaura.

00:40:04.290 --> 00:40:06.670
Ma.

00:40:56.210 --> 00:40:58.310
Pi? Huh?

00:41:01.970 --> 00:41:03.980
Pika?

00:41:04.010 --> 00:41:06.110
Huh? Pika.

00:41:06.140 --> 00:41:08.780
It must be that they're
scared because we're here.

00:41:08.810 --> 00:41:13.120
Well, we may be humans,
but Pokémon are still Pokémon!

00:41:13.150 --> 00:41:16.580
All right, now, everybody out!

00:41:22.200 --> 00:41:25.290
Yeah, great idea! I'm in!

00:41:34.340 --> 00:41:37.310
You see? You don't need to be afraid of us.

00:41:37.340 --> 00:41:39.390
Help us show them we're friendly.

00:41:41.430 --> 00:41:43.440
Pikachu!

00:42:02.110 --> 00:42:04.630
Cha, cha, cha!

00:42:04.660 --> 00:42:07.250
Hawlucha!

00:42:07.290 --> 00:42:11.420
Pikachu.

00:42:11.460 --> 00:42:13.880
Pika?

00:42:32.640 --> 00:42:35.990
Wow, this is great! Yeah!

00:42:39.360 --> 00:42:42.540
Huh? Volcanion, are you OK?

00:42:42.570 --> 00:42:45.670
Hey, wait a minute - the Pokémon hunter!

00:42:45.700 --> 00:42:48.500
You need help too. I need nothing.

00:42:48.540 --> 00:42:52.090
Magearna, stay out of the
flower field for a while, OK?

00:42:54.710 --> 00:42:56.890
But what about you?

00:42:56.920 --> 00:42:59.010
Argh!

00:42:59.050 --> 00:43:01.600
Hey, wait for me! Bonnie!

00:43:03.170 --> 00:43:05.270
Pika, pi!

00:43:12.100 --> 00:43:13.990
Huh?

00:43:14.020 --> 00:43:17.820
- It's a hot spring. - Like a giant bath.

00:43:17.860 --> 00:43:19.950
A bath will fix me right up.

00:43:21.360 --> 00:43:23.450
Wow.

00:43:23.490 --> 00:43:25.580
Argh!

00:43:30.200 --> 00:43:34.470
Quick, Ash, you've gotta
get out of there right away!

00:43:34.500 --> 00:43:37.380
Huh? Whoa!

00:43:37.420 --> 00:43:39.760
Your suit's absorbing the water!

00:43:39.790 --> 00:43:41.890
Argh!

00:43:44.380 --> 00:43:47.770
Whooooaa!

00:43:49.970 --> 00:43:52.820
And then some.

00:43:54.980 --> 00:43:58.320
You humans are an annoying bunch.

00:44:07.610 --> 00:44:10.080
Wrench, please. Bunnelby.

00:44:10.120 --> 00:44:12.750
Che. Thanks a lot.

00:44:15.910 --> 00:44:17.760
Chespin? Bunnelby?

00:44:17.790 --> 00:44:20.180
Working on gadgets along with Pokémon -

00:44:20.210 --> 00:44:22.970
I'm sure it must have
been like this for Nikola too.

00:44:23.000 --> 00:44:28.190
Nikola thought the world needed both
humans and Pokémon to be in harmony.

00:44:28.220 --> 00:44:31.810
Which I believe is what
inspired him to create Magearna.

00:44:31.850 --> 00:44:36.280
Magearna's the living embodiment
of the philosophy of arcane science.

00:44:36.310 --> 00:44:40.660
At least, that's the way
I prefer to interpret that.

00:44:40.690 --> 00:44:43.530
It's such a beautiful idea.

00:44:46.360 --> 00:44:49.750
So, you're always here,
watching out for everyone.

00:44:49.780 --> 00:44:53.590
It's because I never know
when I might explode.

00:44:53.620 --> 00:44:56.460
You've got that right! Pikachu.

00:44:56.500 --> 00:44:58.630
Why don't you two get some sleep?

00:44:58.670 --> 00:45:01.260
You're keeping watch, I am too.

00:45:01.290 --> 00:45:03.140
Pika, pikachu.

00:45:03.170 --> 00:45:05.680
Do as you like. I will.

00:45:05.710 --> 00:45:08.060
Pika, pika.

00:45:23.480 --> 00:45:28.080
Ta-da! Your clothes, they're all clean.

00:45:28.110 --> 00:45:31.710
Wow, thanks a lot, Serena. Pikachu!

00:45:37.500 --> 00:45:39.590
Huh?

00:46:03.190 --> 00:46:05.950
Oh, boy, this won't be easy.

00:46:18.410 --> 00:46:20.630
Yes!

00:46:24.710 --> 00:46:27.350
It worked!

00:46:40.180 --> 00:46:43.280
Yay! They brought those berries for us.

00:46:49.610 --> 00:46:52.710
Incredible. I never thought I'd see

00:46:52.740 --> 00:46:55.710
humans and Pokémon
getting along together here.

00:46:57.450 --> 00:47:01.710
All these Pokémon, they've
been hurt by humans, haven't they?

00:47:01.750 --> 00:47:04.590
Yes, they have. You too?

00:47:04.620 --> 00:47:08.260
Don't worry about what happened to me.

00:47:12.050 --> 00:47:14.730
Pika?

00:47:14.760 --> 00:47:19.060
All fixed, good as new! Next time,
we're gonna be working on you.

00:47:19.100 --> 00:47:22.070
Working on us? Pika?

00:47:24.770 --> 00:47:26.860
Watch what this one can do.

00:47:37.820 --> 00:47:40.210
It's about time.

00:47:40.240 --> 00:47:43.920
It worked! Thanks so much, Gulpin.

00:47:43.960 --> 00:47:46.050
Gu... gu...

00:47:46.080 --> 00:47:48.180
Gulpin!

00:47:48.210 --> 00:47:50.140
Gulpin.

00:47:50.170 --> 00:47:52.060
Huh? Pika?

00:47:52.090 --> 00:47:57.140
This Gulpin has its reasons.
Anyway, the bands are gone. Leave.

00:47:57.180 --> 00:48:00.310
Even after all that's happened?

00:48:00.350 --> 00:48:03.400
After everybody's starting
to get along so well?

00:48:03.430 --> 00:48:05.690
Doesn't mean anything. It does too!

00:48:05.730 --> 00:48:08.160
You only did that because
we were stuck together.

00:48:08.190 --> 00:48:12.370
Hey, I really like Pokémon.
I wanna protect them too.

00:48:12.400 --> 00:48:14.290
If you're gonna be a Pokémon trainer,

00:48:14.320 --> 00:48:17.120
then you've gotta learn how
to make Pokémon feel safe.

00:48:17.160 --> 00:48:19.330
Right, buddy? Pika, pika.

00:48:19.370 --> 00:48:23.880
Spare me your pretty
words or I'll blast you!

00:48:23.910 --> 00:48:26.380
You try it! Pika!

00:48:39.180 --> 00:48:41.270
I'm going to sleep.

00:49:20.010 --> 00:49:22.230
What? I brought Poképuffs.

00:49:22.260 --> 00:49:25.190
Serena and Chymia made them. Pika.

00:49:25.220 --> 00:49:27.480
Huh? Gu.

00:49:27.520 --> 00:49:29.700
You were surprised back there, weren't you?

00:49:29.730 --> 00:49:31.610
They just didn't understand.

00:49:31.650 --> 00:49:34.990
Please forgive them. Gulpin.

00:49:35.030 --> 00:49:38.040
I'm sorry, Gulpin. Pikachu.

00:49:42.450 --> 00:49:46.670
This little one came here after
being abandoned by its trainer.

00:49:46.700 --> 00:49:48.840
Huh? Pika?

00:49:48.870 --> 00:49:52.010
I don't know if anything
happened before that.

00:49:52.040 --> 00:49:55.140
It doesn't tell me and I don't ask.

00:49:55.170 --> 00:49:59.220
The only thing I know is
that right before its trainer left,

00:49:59.260 --> 00:50:02.480
he gave Gulpin a big hug.

00:50:07.930 --> 00:50:10.940
All of the Pokémon here have been wounded

00:50:10.980 --> 00:50:14.110
by the selfishness and lies of humans.

00:50:14.150 --> 00:50:16.030
They may be laughing now,

00:50:16.070 --> 00:50:18.910
but they're wounded, deeply wounded.

00:50:18.940 --> 00:50:24.540
And that's the reason I can't trust humans.

00:50:24.570 --> 00:50:27.380
Pokémon are incapable of lying.

00:50:27.410 --> 00:50:30.920
But humans are and do!

00:50:30.960 --> 00:50:34.010
Pika, pika, pika, pi.

00:50:34.040 --> 00:50:36.970
Really, this one doesn't lie?

00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:40.180
Pika, pikachu, pikachu!

00:50:40.220 --> 00:50:44.520
He fights with all he has
to protect the ones he loves.

00:50:44.550 --> 00:50:46.980
Pika, pika. Thank you for that.

00:50:47.010 --> 00:50:49.150
You're right. Pikachu!

00:50:49.180 --> 00:50:52.860
Both of you are spewing
nothing but flowery sentiments.

00:50:52.890 --> 00:50:54.990
I'm sorry.

00:50:55.020 --> 00:50:58.950
Before the others get used
to you, I want you to leave.

00:50:58.980 --> 00:51:01.040
Though I'm very grateful to you

00:51:01.070 --> 00:51:03.830
for what you did for Magearna and Amaura.

00:51:08.280 --> 00:51:11.590
Here, go ahead and eat.

00:51:18.290 --> 00:51:20.390
Mmm, not bad.

00:51:20.420 --> 00:51:23.770
If you like it, then why
don't you say you like it?

00:51:23.800 --> 00:51:26.650
Eat, both of you.

00:51:31.430 --> 00:51:34.650
Pi, pika?

00:51:34.690 --> 00:51:36.780
Huh?

00:51:38.270 --> 00:51:40.370
What is that?

00:51:42.490 --> 00:51:44.580
Gar!

00:51:59.040 --> 00:52:01.140
Argh!

00:52:19.400 --> 00:52:22.490
Braixen, Talonflame! Luxray, Greninja!

00:52:32.490 --> 00:52:34.590
Everyone!

00:52:34.620 --> 00:52:36.720
Ash!

00:52:40.130 --> 00:52:42.220
Argh!

00:52:47.430 --> 00:52:49.520
Huh?

00:52:53.970 --> 00:52:56.070
You two!

00:52:58.230 --> 00:53:00.860
Well, well.

00:53:06.240 --> 00:53:08.500
If you resist...

00:53:14.950 --> 00:53:16.840
You're the worst! Pika!

00:53:16.870 --> 00:53:20.840
They're humans. They think
nothing of the lives of Pokémon.

00:53:20.880 --> 00:53:23.930
Hey, I'll blast you!

00:53:23.960 --> 00:53:27.600
Manetric, Electric Terrain!
Steelix, use Stealth Rock!

00:53:27.630 --> 00:53:30.520
Manetric!

00:53:32.680 --> 00:53:34.770
Oh, no!

00:53:34.810 --> 00:53:36.780
Steeelix!

00:53:36.810 --> 00:53:39.610
How dare you?

00:53:43.150 --> 00:53:46.990
If you wanna help them,

00:53:47.030 --> 00:53:48.950
then you should come with us.

00:53:48.990 --> 00:53:52.750
If you do, then everybody's happy.

00:53:52.780 --> 00:53:55.920
No, don't go, Magearna!

00:53:55.950 --> 00:53:58.050
Then I've no choice.

00:54:02.330 --> 00:54:06.010
You'll pay for this! Argh!

00:54:13.390 --> 00:54:15.480
Magearna!

00:54:15.510 --> 00:54:17.610
Pika!

00:54:20.520 --> 00:54:23.280
So now you understand.

00:54:23.310 --> 00:54:25.410
Use Psychic.

00:54:33.530 --> 00:54:35.630
Magearna!

00:54:35.660 --> 00:54:37.750
Argh!

00:54:55.600 --> 00:54:57.980
Rali! Alva!

00:54:58.010 --> 00:55:00.030
Everything's OK!

00:55:00.060 --> 00:55:03.320
All of this is for our kingdom.

00:55:03.350 --> 00:55:05.450
Ugh.

00:55:07.610 --> 00:55:11.120
Alva, why don't we tell them everything?

00:55:11.150 --> 00:55:14.250
What an incredible
creation Magearna really is!

00:55:14.280 --> 00:55:18.500
Fine. Gengar, Mean Look. Gen.

00:55:18.540 --> 00:55:22.050
Huh?

00:55:24.330 --> 00:55:26.430
Gen.

00:55:28.590 --> 00:55:30.680
Wait a minute!

00:55:30.710 --> 00:55:33.180
You don't have to remove its Soul-Heart!

00:55:33.220 --> 00:55:36.020
That's just as long as
Magearna becomes a sphere.

00:55:36.050 --> 00:55:38.190
Nikola said that... argh!

00:55:38.220 --> 00:55:41.110
All that I really need is its Soul-Heart.

00:55:41.140 --> 00:55:43.740
You can't! If you remove it then...

00:55:55.910 --> 00:55:58.040
Alva, what happened?

00:55:58.070 --> 00:56:02.460
It's gone. Gengar, kindly return Magearna.

00:56:02.500 --> 00:56:05.590
Gen... gar!

00:56:10.960 --> 00:56:16.600
Chymia, your presence is not
required for my plan. Farewell.

00:56:16.630 --> 00:56:18.730
Use Hyper Beam.

00:56:27.560 --> 00:56:30.870
How could you lie to me?
It wasn't for the kingdom!

00:56:30.900 --> 00:56:35.660
Yes, it was all done for the
glory of the Kingdom of Azoth.

00:56:35.700 --> 00:56:39.420
My ideal one, of course.

00:56:39.450 --> 00:56:41.540
Gengar, Hypnosis.

00:56:41.580 --> 00:56:43.670
Gengar.

00:57:07.850 --> 00:57:10.610
They used Dig and Safeguard!

00:57:10.650 --> 00:57:13.080
Thank you, everyone. Hippow.

00:57:14.530 --> 00:57:16.620
Magearna!

00:57:21.990 --> 00:57:24.090
Huh?

00:57:48.440 --> 00:57:51.410
Volcanion. Pika.

00:57:58.110 --> 00:58:01.960
If its Soul-Heart is returned,
Magearna should be revived.

00:58:01.990 --> 00:58:04.080
Huh?

00:58:05.910 --> 00:58:08.010
Everyone on board!

00:58:10.330 --> 00:58:13.800
Prince Rali, I thought
that you would understand,

00:58:13.840 --> 00:58:17.850
that you would be able to
comprehend my noblest of dreams.

00:58:17.880 --> 00:58:20.680
There's no reason to make such a big fuss.

00:58:20.720 --> 00:58:23.350
We're only talking about one Pokémon.

00:58:30.980 --> 00:58:33.860
It's Magearna!

00:58:33.900 --> 00:58:39.080
I can sense it right from here.
Poor Magearna. It's crying!

00:58:39.110 --> 00:58:44.500
In that case, it's retrieve
the Soul-Heart or bust!

00:58:44.530 --> 00:58:47.000
Gengar, Psychic.

00:58:47.040 --> 00:58:51.050
Gar. You're even less than useless to me.

00:59:09.270 --> 00:59:11.490
That field of flowers,

00:59:11.520 --> 00:59:14.780
that's where I met Magearna
for the very first time.

00:59:14.810 --> 00:59:17.280
Wasn't it 500 years ago?

00:59:17.320 --> 00:59:20.160
I don't know how you humans measure time.

00:59:20.190 --> 00:59:23.540
But it's a story from the ancient past.

00:59:38.040 --> 00:59:41.390
Then, as now, the plateau was my home.

00:59:41.420 --> 00:59:44.480
As that of many, many
other troubled Pokémon.

00:59:44.510 --> 00:59:48.810
Oftentimes, I would check the
area for Pokémon that were lost

00:59:48.850 --> 00:59:51.440
and had collapsed from exhaustion.

01:00:08.950 --> 01:00:11.210
Magearna was the first one I met

01:00:11.240 --> 01:00:13.800
that wasn't blown away by my explosions.

01:00:13.830 --> 01:00:16.880
Magearna liked to take care of others.

01:00:16.920 --> 01:00:19.300
It seems that even within the kingdom,

01:00:19.340 --> 01:00:21.890
it was always caring for other Pokémon.

01:00:34.850 --> 01:00:37.320
I promise I will save Magearna,

01:00:37.350 --> 01:00:41.080
for its sake and for everyone
who lives on the plateau.

01:00:47.200 --> 01:00:50.580
Huh? They're still kicking too!

01:00:56.160 --> 01:00:59.090
Liftoff!

01:01:01.960 --> 01:01:04.600
What is it, Flamel?

01:01:04.630 --> 01:01:06.810
Princess, I have something to report.

01:01:06.840 --> 01:01:09.310
A previously unseen
design diagram by Nikola

01:01:09.340 --> 01:01:11.310
was found in Prince Rali's room.

01:01:11.350 --> 01:01:13.440
Design diagram?

01:01:13.470 --> 01:01:17.490
Nikola designed a number of
gadgets for defending the kingdom.

01:01:17.520 --> 01:01:21.660
The strongest of them being
the wall that presently surrounds it.

01:01:21.690 --> 01:01:24.240
Part of the wall that
defends the Azoth kingdom

01:01:24.280 --> 01:01:26.910
can seperate and turn
into a floating fortress.

01:01:26.950 --> 01:01:31.040
It was designed as protection
in times of an emergency.

01:01:31.070 --> 01:01:36.420
However, an uprising broke out
over just who would claim that power.

01:01:36.450 --> 01:01:38.590
To stop the fighting,

01:01:38.620 --> 01:01:42.050
Nikola sealed the fortress
so that it wasn't able to move.

01:01:42.090 --> 01:01:45.850
Sealed in the darkness of
history, along with Magearna.

01:01:45.880 --> 01:01:48.640
Sealed it? What do you mean, sealed?

01:01:48.680 --> 01:01:54.310
500 years ago, Magearna was
not simply the princess's playmate.

01:01:54.350 --> 01:01:56.230
It had another role -

01:01:56.270 --> 01:01:59.070
to defend the princess as
well as defend the kingdom.

01:01:59.100 --> 01:02:02.660
How was it done? Using this.

01:02:08.320 --> 01:02:12.790
Its power has been sealed off,
but by using neo-arcane science,

01:02:12.820 --> 01:02:16.210
it will finally be reawakened!

01:03:10.840 --> 01:03:12.940
What's going on?

01:03:15.050 --> 01:03:18.570
Is that...? It's Nikola's
floating fortress!

01:03:19.600 --> 01:03:23.950
And to move the tower,
they required the Soul-Heart.

01:03:28.980 --> 01:03:32.620
Still here, princess, I see. Very well.

01:03:32.650 --> 01:03:38.460
After 500 years I know what
my fortress's first prey shall be;

01:03:38.490 --> 01:03:40.920
the princess!

01:03:43.040 --> 01:03:45.680
But Jess! But James!

01:04:02.600 --> 01:04:05.490
You can do it, Pikachu! Pika! Pika!

01:04:06.520 --> 01:04:08.700
- Let's get going. - Right!

01:04:15.570 --> 01:04:18.000
Now fire!

01:04:19.950 --> 01:04:22.130
Huh? I said FIRE!

01:04:29.250 --> 01:04:32.640
It's sufferin'.

01:04:32.670 --> 01:04:35.560
Magearna's sufferin'!

01:04:39.010 --> 01:04:41.610
This power was purposely created

01:04:41.640 --> 01:04:44.990
to make all the people
of the kingdom happy,

01:04:45.020 --> 01:04:47.910
but all it did was incite war and hatred.

01:04:48.940 --> 01:04:51.330
Our citizens are wounded.

01:04:57.070 --> 01:05:02.710
Magearna, I'm afraid I have
no choice but to hide you away

01:05:02.740 --> 01:05:04.960
so the people aren't able to find you.

01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:07.510
I did my best.

01:05:07.540 --> 01:05:09.300
I'm sorry.

01:05:17.260 --> 01:05:19.810
Magearna's still in there!

01:05:19.840 --> 01:05:21.980
It says it doesn't wanna do this!

01:05:22.010 --> 01:05:24.230
It's sufferin'!

01:05:25.600 --> 01:05:30.490
Magearna, so a piece of
your heart is still remaining.

01:05:43.540 --> 01:05:45.800
Mega Wave.

01:06:10.560 --> 01:06:12.870
Pika. Pikachu!

01:06:13.690 --> 01:06:15.700
Kazam!

01:06:57.230 --> 01:07:00.750
Pi-ka-CHU!

01:07:36.020 --> 01:07:38.910
Greninja, let's power up!

01:07:38.940 --> 01:07:42.120
Ooh-cha!

01:07:45.910 --> 01:07:49.800
We're not gonna give in to
Mega Evolution without real bonds.

01:07:54.750 --> 01:07:57.550
Champit!

01:08:02.720 --> 01:08:04.810
Pika!

01:08:05.140 --> 01:08:07.150
Pikachu!

01:08:09.970 --> 01:08:13.320
Pikachu?! Squishy, wait!

01:08:29.200 --> 01:08:31.670
Pika!

01:08:40.710 --> 01:08:42.470
Chu!

01:08:46.550 --> 01:08:49.610
Squishy!

01:08:49.640 --> 01:08:53.570
Go on, they'll take care of this.
Let's leave the rest to the Pokémon.

01:08:53.600 --> 01:08:56.240
OK. Let's get inside, quick. Right!

01:08:57.400 --> 01:08:59.660
Stop!

01:09:01.520 --> 01:09:04.120
Right under here. OK. Stand back.

01:09:10.160 --> 01:09:12.210
Let's go. Grab on!

01:09:19.460 --> 01:09:23.510
Uh... It feels like... we're moving. Huh?

01:09:37.810 --> 01:09:39.910
Boy, here come the twerps!

01:09:40.940 --> 01:09:42.490
Oh!

01:09:47.070 --> 01:09:51.540
Rali? Princess Chymia. You're looking well.

01:09:51.570 --> 01:09:54.460
The Pokémon of Nebel Plateau protected me.

01:09:55.500 --> 01:09:57.420
So they did, so they did.

01:10:05.800 --> 01:10:11.060
I'm warning you. If you move
around too much, they'll tighten up.

01:10:11.090 --> 01:10:12.860
That's nonsense!

01:10:16.660 --> 01:10:21.850
Oh, yes. I was going to show
you the magnificence of Magearna.

01:10:21.880 --> 01:10:25.060
Unfortunately I'm unable to
demonstrate its true power

01:10:25.090 --> 01:10:27.140
at the present time.

01:10:29.930 --> 01:10:33.070
See, part of its heart still remains.

01:10:33.770 --> 01:10:37.190
Mean Look, if you please. GENGAR!

01:10:39.520 --> 01:10:42.780
See, it is no longer able to resist.

01:10:45.100 --> 01:10:46.780
Huh?!

01:10:47.810 --> 01:10:49.950
What are you going to do?

01:10:52.570 --> 01:10:57.000
Please behold the magnificence
of Magearna's power.

01:10:57.030 --> 01:10:58.960
It's strugglin'!

01:10:58.990 --> 01:11:01.920
Magearna's resisting with all its got!

01:11:01.950 --> 01:11:03.670
Huh?

01:11:05.410 --> 01:11:10.430
When either humans or Pokémon
lose the things that they truly love,

01:11:10.460 --> 01:11:12.260
their hearts will break.

01:11:12.300 --> 01:11:14.100
Firing now!

01:11:29.020 --> 01:11:31.160
It missed?

01:11:31.190 --> 01:11:35.200
This is the power; what Nikola feared.

01:11:38.360 --> 01:11:41.880
That voice! Magearna's voice!

01:11:41.910 --> 01:11:44.250
I can't hear it anymore.

01:11:44.290 --> 01:11:46.630
Meowth, what?

01:11:46.660 --> 01:11:49.430
Magearna... Poor Magearna.

01:11:49.460 --> 01:11:52.430
It's really gone!

01:11:52.460 --> 01:11:54.510
What did you say?!

01:11:54.550 --> 01:11:56.470
Meowth, I must thank you.

01:11:56.510 --> 01:11:59.600
It was worth the trouble of
keeping you around after all.

01:11:59.630 --> 01:12:03.480
Its troublesome heart
is finally out of the way.

01:12:03.510 --> 01:12:05.860
It isn't Magearna that I require at all,

01:12:05.890 --> 01:12:08.150
but merely its Soul-Heart.

01:12:08.180 --> 01:12:10.110
You.

01:12:10.150 --> 01:12:14.330
You had all better prepare
yourself. I can't hold back anymore.

01:12:32.790 --> 01:12:35.680
Soul-Heart, this time you will wipe out

01:12:35.710 --> 01:12:38.850
everything that remains on the plateau.

01:12:50.100 --> 01:12:51.860
Hey, Squishy!

01:13:52.370 --> 01:13:54.720
Now what?!

01:13:55.790 --> 01:13:57.930
All right! Pika!

01:14:07.050 --> 01:14:09.320
What?! What happened?

01:14:09.350 --> 01:14:12.940
The Pokémon of Nebel
Plateau. They all protected it.

01:14:12.980 --> 01:14:17.620
It can't be! What can those
pathetic little snivelling Pokémon do?

01:14:17.650 --> 01:14:20.030
Watch your mouth!

01:14:22.820 --> 01:14:24.620
We're not...

01:14:27.530 --> 01:14:30.250
We're not...

01:14:30.290 --> 01:14:33.380
WE'RE NOT PATHETIC!

01:14:45.220 --> 01:14:48.350
Gengar, Shadow Ball!

01:14:48.390 --> 01:14:50.480
Quick, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

01:14:51.510 --> 01:14:54.190
Pika-chu!

01:14:54.230 --> 01:14:56.240
Now use Electroball!

01:14:56.270 --> 01:14:58.820
Pika, pika, Pikachu!

01:14:59.770 --> 01:15:01.700
Argh!

01:15:20.790 --> 01:15:22.810
Gengar!

01:15:34.350 --> 01:15:37.190
I don't think Alva is doing too well.

01:15:44.480 --> 01:15:47.160
It looks like they've all woken up.

01:15:58.830 --> 01:16:01.970
You're awake!

01:16:02.000 --> 01:16:04.720
Chymia!

01:16:04.750 --> 01:16:08.140
Dear Meowth. It's James, and Jessie!

01:16:10.840 --> 01:16:13.190
Volcanion, we got it!

01:16:13.220 --> 01:16:15.570
Hm-hm.

01:16:20.190 --> 01:16:22.240
Huh?

01:16:22.900 --> 01:16:26.290
Unfortunately, it seems my plans end here.

01:16:26.320 --> 01:16:28.620
It's quite obvious it's
time to give them up.

01:16:30.610 --> 01:16:34.630
I'll simply find a new
puppet to replace Prince Rali.

01:16:39.790 --> 01:16:42.090
Quick, Greninja, Water Shuriken!

01:16:47.010 --> 01:16:49.480
Huh?

01:16:49.510 --> 01:16:52.230
ARGH!

01:16:53.260 --> 01:16:55.110
Ninja!

01:17:05.070 --> 01:17:08.450
Cut it out! Glalalie!

01:17:17.200 --> 01:17:19.090
Ash!

01:17:19.120 --> 01:17:22.970
Everybody OK? And the Soul-Heart?

01:17:34.300 --> 01:17:36.440
Pi. Hm.

01:17:41.810 --> 01:17:44.990
Hm?

01:17:53.820 --> 01:17:56.500
Magearna, we're here.

01:18:00.660 --> 01:18:02.720
Huh?

01:18:02.750 --> 01:18:05.300
Its heart is still broken.

01:18:05.330 --> 01:18:08.720
Sure it can move and all that stuff,

01:18:08.750 --> 01:18:13.520
but now, Magearna's
voice, I can't hear it at all!

01:18:30.070 --> 01:18:33.620
Oh no, the fortress is set
to fall into Nebel Plateau!

01:18:35.530 --> 01:18:37.630
Can it be stopped? It can't.

01:18:37.660 --> 01:18:39.960
It looks like the control system is out.

01:18:39.990 --> 01:18:41.880
All because of Alva.

01:18:42.950 --> 01:18:45.470
And even if we were able to escape...

01:18:57.220 --> 01:18:59.560
Isn't there any way at all?

01:18:59.600 --> 01:19:01.860
We're can't change course.

01:19:01.890 --> 01:19:05.440
The only way would be to explode
the fortress into a pile of dust.

01:19:06.520 --> 01:19:09.320
Explosions are my speciality!

01:19:09.360 --> 01:19:11.330
Hold on!

01:19:11.360 --> 01:19:13.410
You're out of water.

01:19:15.280 --> 01:19:18.830
Part of the fortress runs on
steam, so it has water tanks!

01:19:19.870 --> 01:19:22.090
Volcanion, I'll take you there.

01:19:22.120 --> 01:19:24.380
Please do.

01:19:24.410 --> 01:19:27.880
Everybody, wait on my
sister's flying machine.

01:19:27.920 --> 01:19:30.550
I'm going with you! Pikachu!

01:19:36.260 --> 01:19:38.390
Over here!

01:19:40.430 --> 01:19:42.820
I can smell water.

01:19:48.480 --> 01:19:50.990
This thing's really stuck!

01:19:51.020 --> 01:19:55.120
I've got it. Go for it, Pikachu, Iron Tail!

01:19:55.150 --> 01:19:57.040
Pika!

01:20:02.490 --> 01:20:04.590
Hey, thanks.

01:20:10.330 --> 01:20:12.430
It's moving.

01:20:18.260 --> 01:20:21.100
All right.

01:20:34.900 --> 01:20:37.330
Excuse me, you said
your name was Ash, right?

01:20:37.360 --> 01:20:39.410
That's right.

01:20:39.450 --> 01:20:42.170
I've been acting like such a fool,

01:20:42.200 --> 01:20:45.670
spending so long shutting
myself up in my lab.

01:20:45.700 --> 01:20:51.930
That's why... Alva had such an
easy time tricking me that way.

01:20:51.960 --> 01:20:54.010
Know what I think?

01:20:54.040 --> 01:20:58.020
You should head out on your
own journey with the Pokémon.

01:20:58.050 --> 01:21:01.560
Huh? Mhm. Pikachu!

01:21:29.960 --> 01:21:32.050
Volcanion?

01:21:32.080 --> 01:21:35.930
Say, perhaps I should
create an explosion right here?

01:21:35.960 --> 01:21:39.810
It is centre of the fortress, so
I do think it would be effective,

01:21:39.840 --> 01:21:44.440
but then you won't be
able to escape. Pika, pika!

01:21:44.470 --> 01:21:46.400
Yeah, that's the truth.

01:21:46.430 --> 01:21:49.440
You said you're powerful
enough to level a mountain, right?

01:21:49.470 --> 01:21:52.360
So why not follow the plan
and blow it up from outside?

01:21:52.390 --> 01:21:54.450
Hm...

01:21:54.480 --> 01:21:57.490
Agreed. We should all go back together.

01:21:57.520 --> 01:21:59.490
Yeah! Pika!

01:21:59.530 --> 01:22:01.790
Huh? Let's hurry.

01:22:24.800 --> 01:22:26.900
OK, Volcanion, go get 'em!

01:22:26.930 --> 01:22:29.060
Mm!

01:22:39.400 --> 01:22:41.580
Get on board after the blast.

01:22:41.610 --> 01:22:43.950
All right, just go!

01:22:47.530 --> 01:22:49.460
Argh! Pika!

01:22:51.700 --> 01:22:53.710
Volcanion!

01:22:57.540 --> 01:23:00.100
No, you can't do that!

01:23:16.730 --> 01:23:19.740
Well, I'm going out with a bang.

01:23:19.770 --> 01:23:22.240
Time to blast!

01:23:30.450 --> 01:23:34.550
Magearna, I couldn't protect you.

01:23:34.580 --> 01:23:37.170
Forgive me.

01:23:47.260 --> 01:23:49.350
Volcanion...

01:24:19.540 --> 01:24:22.140
You've lied to us.

01:24:22.170 --> 01:24:24.430
You said we'd all go back together.

01:24:24.460 --> 01:24:26.810
Pika, pika!

01:24:49.950 --> 01:24:52.120
Magearna?

01:24:52.160 --> 01:24:54.290
The Nebel Plateau Pokémon are safe.

01:24:54.330 --> 01:24:56.500
Volcanion protected them.

01:24:57.830 --> 01:25:00.880
I wish you could hear what I'm saying.

01:25:21.520 --> 01:25:23.610
Ugh...

01:25:29.610 --> 01:25:31.660
Huh?

01:25:37.790 --> 01:25:40.260
Huh? Look at the mist!

01:25:48.630 --> 01:25:50.720
Huh?

01:26:35.180 --> 01:26:37.560
Magearna!

01:27:03.870 --> 01:27:06.340
Huh?

01:27:06.370 --> 01:27:09.600
Volcanion, hang in there! Pikachu!

01:27:09.630 --> 01:27:12.430
Volcanion?

01:27:16.010 --> 01:27:18.650
Oh! Pika...

01:27:36.990 --> 01:27:39.500
Uh... Uh...

01:27:39.530 --> 01:27:43.500
Huh... Argh!

01:27:48.330 --> 01:27:51.100
I told you not to do that!

01:27:54.710 --> 01:27:57.230
You? You're still here?

01:27:57.260 --> 01:28:00.350
I said I want to protect Pokémon, right?

01:28:01.470 --> 01:28:03.820
I would never tell a lie.

01:28:03.850 --> 01:28:05.780
Pika, pika!

01:28:05.810 --> 01:28:08.450
Hm, all of you!

01:28:09.850 --> 01:28:11.910
You know what?

01:28:12.940 --> 01:28:17.710
I'm going to make you all
honorary Nebel Plateau Pokémon.

01:28:17.740 --> 01:28:22.210
Honorary Pokémon? Hey, I
think that sounds really cool!

01:28:22.240 --> 01:28:23.960
Yeah, I wanna be one!

01:28:25.790 --> 01:28:27.920
Yeah, right, Squishy?

01:28:27.960 --> 01:28:32.010
Well, I'm happy to
accept. It's a real honour.

01:28:35.460 --> 01:28:37.470
Pika!

01:28:37.510 --> 01:28:39.520
Pika, pika! Pika, pika!

01:28:41.970 --> 01:28:44.320
Hey, electric nuisance. Pika.

01:28:44.350 --> 01:28:48.940
You're friend Ash. He always seems
to be getting himself into trouble.

01:28:48.980 --> 01:28:50.860
Pika?

01:28:50.900 --> 01:28:53.450
Take extra good care of him.

01:28:54.650 --> 01:28:56.830
Pika, Pikachu!

01:28:56.860 --> 01:28:59.290
He-he-he!

01:29:32.690 --> 01:29:35.410
♪ One of a kind

01:29:35.440 --> 01:29:39.240
♪ Forged of steel from a beautiful mind

01:29:40.400 --> 01:29:44.670
♪ And with a mighty heart

01:29:44.700 --> 01:29:49.130
♪ That drove men apart

01:29:50.040 --> 01:29:52.260
♪ A forgotten plain

01:29:52.290 --> 01:29:56.390
♪ Where only the damaged remained

01:29:57.420 --> 01:30:03.520
♪ That's where I found my destiny

01:30:05.180 --> 01:30:08.690
♪ One more lost refugee

01:30:09.720 --> 01:30:14.020
♪ Come with me, feel my Soul-Heart

01:30:14.070 --> 01:30:18.210
♪ If you've been seeking a new start

01:30:18.240 --> 01:30:23.090
♪ Let me be your guiding knight

01:30:23.120 --> 01:30:27.590
♪ Till the end of the night

01:30:27.630 --> 01:30:31.470
♪ Close your eyes, know my Soul-Heart

01:30:31.510 --> 01:30:35.890
♪ Keeping watch over the rampart

01:30:35.930 --> 01:30:40.730
♪ Let me be your shining star

01:30:40.760 --> 01:30:44.860
♪ Leading bright from afar

01:30:44.890 --> 01:30:49.190
♪ From wherever you were

01:30:49.350 --> 01:30:52.530
♪ To wherever you are

01:30:52.560 --> 01:30:57.400
♪ Feel my Soul-Heart now

01:30:59.870 --> 01:31:02.420
♪ Dry all your tears

01:31:02.450 --> 01:31:06.880
♪ I've returned after so many years

01:31:06.920 --> 01:31:13.560
♪ Let the creatures I cherish flourish now

01:31:16.050 --> 01:31:18.730
♪ This is my vow

01:31:19.640 --> 01:31:23.920
♪ Know forever, my Soul-Heart

01:31:23.960 --> 01:31:28.260
♪ Anyone seeking a new start

01:31:28.300 --> 01:31:32.710
♪ Let me be your guiding light

01:31:32.840 --> 01:31:37.810
♪ Till the end of the night ♪

01:34:23.100 --> 01:34:26.240
subtitles by Deluxe
